  "description": {
    "text": "Xerneas Deck 30, a half deck released on 31 January 2014 together with Yveltal Deck 30, and sold early at the Jisedai World Hobby Fair '14 Winter. It holds Fairy-type Pokémon led by Xerneas, with the Trainer cards and Fairy Energy a Fairy deck needs, a player's guide and a quick guide, plus a special Collection X booster pack: five random cards and an original holo Clefairy found in no ordinary Collection X pack. Cards from the Collection X and Collection Y expansions make it stronger.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: 「ゼルネアスデッキ30」「イベルタルデッキ30」",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20140117213655/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/xy/x30y30.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
        "url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9D%E3%82%B1%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E7%99%BA%E5%A3%B2%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7"
